      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngomnyaka wokufika kwenduna enkulu, eyayithunywe nguSarigoni inkosi yaseAsiriya eAshidodi, yalihlasela, yalithatha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalesosikhathi iNkosi uNkulunkulu yayikhulume kuIsaya indodana kaAmozi yathi: Khulula isaka oligqokileyo, ukhuphe amanyathelo akho enyaweni zakho; wenza njalo, wahambaze engafakanga lamanyathelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yathi: Njengalokhu inceku yami uIsaya isihambeze, ingafakanga lamanyathelo okweminyaka emithathu, lokhu kuyisibonakaliso lemihlolo kwabaseGibithe labaseEtiyopiya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngokunjaloke inkosi yaseAsiriya izakubathumba abaseGibithe labaseEtiyopiya, abatsha labadala, bahambeze bengafakanga amanyathelo, lezibunu zabo zisegcekeni, kube lihlazo eGibithe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bazaphela amandla, babe lenhloni ngeEtiyopiya ithemba labo, langeGibithe igugu labo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalolosuku abakhileyo kuleli elingasolwandle bazakuthi: Khangela, sokwenzeke lokho kulabo ebesithemba kibo ukuba basisize, basikhulule enkosini yaseAsiriya. Phoke, thina sizakuphunyuka kanjani?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
